WEBVTT

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.690
– tev tagad ir 19 –

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:35.310
vai tu iedomājies sevi
turpinām strādāt ar enerģiju?

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:40.340
V.K.: Jā, es domāju
turpināt strādāt ar enerģiju.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:41.450
K.A.: Vareni.
V.K.: Jā.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.350
K.A.: Viljam, mums ir liels gods,
ka esi šeit, TED konferencē.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:45.370
Paldies, ka ieradies.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.425
V.K.: Paldies jums.

00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:48.409
(Aplausi)

00:03:48.409 --> 00:03:51.584
K.A.: Viljam! Redzi?

00:03:51.584 --> 00:03:53.518
(Aplausi)